@CLI_TOOL_NAME@ for Debian

This package ships install-time artifacts for the @CLI_SANDBOX_USERNAME@ execution boundary:

- system user: @CLI_SANDBOX_USERNAME@
- group: @CLI_SANDBOX_GROUPNAME@
- /home/@CLI_SANDBOX_USERNAME@/shared (setgid) workspace root
- sudoers wrapper for running a hardened command as @CLI_SANDBOX_USERNAME@

User enrollment

Add your user to the @CLI_SANDBOX_GROUPNAME@ group and re-login:

  sudo usermod -a -G @CLI_SANDBOX_GROUPNAME@ <username>

Go toolchain

This repository uses a Go toolchain directive (go1.24.12) in go.mod.
If your distro's golang-go is older than the required version, you can install
a newer Go from https://go.dev/dl/ (or use a compatible backport), then rebuild.
